sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Web page / API / CLI
  participant SV as service.process()
  participant CV as convert()
  participant AN as analyze()
  U->>FE: upload file + options (compact, max_tokens, OCR language)
  FE->>SV: bytes, filename, options
  SV->>SV: reject empty files and files over the size limit
  SV->>CV: bytes, filename, options
  CV->>CV: pick converter by extension (pdf, office, image, structured)
  CV-->>SV: ConvertedDocument (Markdown, stats, warnings)
  Note over CV,SV: compact mode runs here, after conversion
  SV->>AN: ConvertedDocument
  AN->>AN: classify, then summarize (extractive by default)
  opt AI summary switched on
    AN->>AN: ask the model, reject numbers that are not in the document
  end
  AN-->>SV: type, confidence, cues, summary, outline
  SV-->>FE: result dict (markdown, analysis, stats, warnings)
  FE->>SV: output_files(result)
  Note over FE,SV: with max_tokens set, the Markdown is split into parts here
  SV-->>FE: one .md file, or several parts
  FE-->>U: download .md (or .zip of parts)
